// Godsmith reset armors (R3 identity rework): per-piece lines remain only for pre-hardmode ore chestplates (mining speed);
// every other set keeps its vanilla piece stats. Set bonus lines open with the vanilla bonus, then the set's signature mechanic.

// Pre-hardmode ores: metal-property ladder (defense only while worn, the property is inherited through helmet nesting)
GsCopperArmor: {
	BodyLine: 5% faster mining speed
	SetBonusLine: 2 more defense; every 6th hit arcs static electricity to the nearest other enemy for 40% of the hit
}

GsTinArmor: {
	BodyLine: 6% faster mining speed
	SetBonusLine: 2 more defense; taking damage rings out a tin chime that knocks nearby enemies away, once every 5 seconds
}

GsIronArmor: {
	BodyLine: 8% faster mining speed
	SetBonusLine: 3 more defense; standing still for 1 second plants you in a cast-iron stance: 5 more defense, 10 armor penetration and immunity to knockback until you move
}

GsLeadArmor: {
	BodyLine: 9% faster mining speed
	SetBonusLine: 3 more defense; hits have a 25% chance to inflict Lead Poisoning (2 damage per second for 4 seconds)
}

GsSilverArmor: {
	BodyLine: 11% faster mining speed
	SetBonusLine: 3 more defense; for 4 seconds after taking damage, life regeneration is greatly increased
}

GsTungstenArmor: {
	BodyLine: 12% faster mining speed
	SetBonusLine: 3 more defense; 30% increased knockback and 4 armor penetration
}

GsGoldArmor: {
	BodyLine: 14% faster mining speed
	SetBonusLine: 4 more defense; every 8th hit flings 3 gold coins at the target, each dealing 35% of the hit
}

GsPlatinumArmor: {
	BodyLine: 15% faster mining speed
	SetBonusLine: 4 more defense; immune to Poisoned, Bleeding, Weak and Darkness
}

// Armor mark debuffs
GsLeadPoisonBuff: {
	DisplayName: Lead Poisoning
	Description: Losing 2 life per second, no regeneration
}

GsAmberSlowBuff: {
	DisplayName: Amber Trapped
	Description: Movement speed reduced by 30%
}

GsWebSlowBuff: {
	DisplayName: Webbed Up
	Description: Movement speed reduced by 30%
}

GsObsidianMarkBuff: {
	DisplayName: Obsidian Mark
	Description: Takes extra damage from minions
}

// The eight wood sets
GsWoodArmor.SetBonusLine: 1 more defense; chopping trees has a chance to drop extra lumber
GsBorealWoodArmor.SetBonusLine: 1 more defense; chopping trees has a chance to drop extra lumber
GsRichMahoganyArmor.SetBonusLine: 1 more defense; chopping trees has a chance to drop extra lumber
GsPalmWoodArmor.SetBonusLine: 1 more defense; chopping trees has a chance to drop extra lumber
GsEbonwoodArmor.SetBonusLine: 1 more defense; chopping trees has a chance to drop extra lumber
GsShadewoodArmor.SetBonusLine: 1 more defense; chopping trees has a chance to drop extra lumber
GsAshWoodArmor.SetBonusLine: 1 more defense and halved lava damage; chopping trees has a chance to drop extra lumber
GsPearlwoodArmor.SetBonusLine: 1 more defense; chopping trees has a chance to drop extra lumber
// Other pre-hardmode sets
GsCactusArmor.SetBonusLine: Enemies that touch you take damage; taking damage bursts 5 cactus needles around you
GsEskimoArmor.SetBonusLine: Immune to Chilled and Frozen; 3 more defense in the snow biome; taking damage shakes off snow that chills nearby enemies for 2 seconds, once every 3 seconds
GsPinkEskimoArmor.SetBonusLine: Immune to Chilled and Frozen; 3 more defense in the snow biome; taking damage shakes off snow that chills nearby enemies for 2 seconds, once every 3 seconds
GsAnglerArmor.SetBonusLine: Fewer enemies spawn while fishing; casts 3 extra fishing lines; chance to catch fish from other biomes or a bundle of 3 to 7 buff potions
GsNinjaArmor.SetBonusLine: 20% increased movement speed; throwing knives, shurikens and spiky balls are not consumed, are thrown 15% faster, deal 3 more damage and inflict Bleeding
GsFossilArmor.SetBonusLine: 20% chance not to consume ammo, and throwing knives, shurikens and spiky balls are not consumed; ranged hits have a 20% chance to trap the enemy in amber, slowing it by 30% for 2 seconds
GsShadowArmor.SetBonusLine: Greatly increased running speed and acceleration; critical strikes inflict Shadowflame for 2 seconds
GsCrimsonArmor.SetBonusLine: Greatly increased life regeneration; hitting an enemy below half life has a 20% chance to release a blood leech that bites it and flies back to heal you for 3
GsMeteorArmor.SetBonusLine: Space Gun costs 0 mana; magic hits have a 15% chance to call a small meteor down onto the target, setting it on fire
GsNecroArmor.SetBonusLine: 10% increased ranged critical strike chance; ranged hits have a 20% chance to hurl a bone at the target, and ranged kills burst three bones from the corpse
GsJungleArmor.SetBonusLine: 16% reduced mana usage; magic hits have a 25% chance to leave a spore cloud on the target that poisons enemies, and every spore hit restores 2 mana
GsBeeArmor.SetBonusLine: 10% increased summon damage; three giant bees circle you and sting any enemy that comes close, and they all swarm whoever hurts you
GsObsidianArmor.SetBonusLine: 15% increased summon damage, 30% increased whip range and 15% increased whip speed; you can walk on hellstone and meteorite; whip hits brand enemies with an Obsidian Mark for 3 seconds, and minions deal 4 extra damage to marked enemies
GsMoltenArmor.SetBonusLine: 10% increased melee damage and immunity to On Fire!; melee hits set enemies on fire, and every 6th melee hit erupts a column of molten fire beneath the target
// Hardmode ores: the helmet's vanilla class set bonus stays, one metal property is layered on top
GsCobaltArmor.SetBonusLine: Your helmet's set bonus works as before; 5 seconds without taking damage puts you in Swift Shadow: 8% increased movement speed, and every 5th hit lets an afterimage lash a cobalt blade at the target for 50% of the hit
GsPalladiumArmor.SetBonusLine: Hitting enemies still grants rapid life regeneration; hitting the same enemy 6 times in a row releases a siphon orb that bites it and flies back to heal you for 8
GsMythrilArmor.SetBonusLine: Your helmet's set bonus works as before; every 8th hit forges a mythril spirit blade over your shoulder that lunges at the target for 60% of the hit
GsOrichalcumArmor.SetBonusLine: Flower petals still fall on hit; every 5th petal to strike the same enemy splits into two extra homing petals
GsTitaniumArmor.SetBonusLine: Hitting an enemy still raises the Titanium Barrier; the more shards orbit you, the more your held weapon gains, up to 15% critical strike chance and 10% damage, but the barrier shatters the moment you take damage
GsAdamantiteArmor.SetBonusLine: Your helmet's set bonus works as before; hits build forge heat (12 stacks, fading after 2 seconds idle), and at full heat the next hit bursts six adamantite embers out of the target for 35% of the hit
// Remaining hardmode and endgame sets
GsSpiderArmor.SetBonusLine: 12% increased summon damage; minion hits have a 20% chance to spit a web that binds the enemy for 2 seconds, and taking damage spits three webs at your attacker, once every 4 seconds
GsFrostArmor.SetBonusLine: Melee and ranged attacks inflict Frostbite and deal 10% more damage; you are immune to Frostburn, Chilled and Frozen; melee and ranged hits have a 20% chance to drop an icicle onto the target for 50% of the hit, and taking damage unleashes a cold snap that freezes nearby enemies for 1 second, once every 10 seconds
GsCrystalAssassinArmor.SetBonusLine: 10% increased damage and critical strike chance, and the ability to dash; dashing into an enemy bursts 5 crystal shards out of it, and your next 3 attacks after a dash are guaranteed critical strikes
GsHallowedArmor.SetBonusLine: Holy Protection works as before (the hood still grants 2 minion slots); when it dodges a hit, 6 holy stars burst out around you and for the next 5 seconds your damage and critical strike chance are increased by 10%
GsBeetleScaleArmor.SetBonusLine: Consecutive hits build Beetle Might, +1 stack per hit up to 20; each stack grants 1% melee damage and 0.5% melee attack speed, and 2 seconds without hitting resets it; at full stacks hits have a 20% chance to send a scarab diving at the target for 60% of the hit
GsBeetleShellArmor.SetBonusLine: Taking damage grants a shell layer (up to 3), each layer giving 6 defense and 6% damage reduction, all fading after 10 seconds without being hit; being hit at 3 layers shatters them into 5 shell shards flung at your attacker, each dealing 2x your defense
GsTurtleArmor.SetBonusLine: 15% damage reduction and melee attackers take double damage back; taking damage launches 8 spikes that each deal 2x your defense, once every 3 seconds
GsTikiArmor.SetBonusLine: +1 minion slot, 20% increased whip range and 10% increased summon damage; minion and whip hits have a 20% chance to call a totem spirit flame that homes in for 60% of the hit and poisons for 3 seconds
GsSpectreHoodArmor.SetBonusLine: Magic hits release healing orbs, but magic damage is reduced by 40%; 100 more maximum mana and faster mana regeneration; taking damage has a 40% chance to instantly heal 10% of your maximum life, once every 8 seconds
GsSpectreMaskArmor.SetBonusLine: Magic hits release lost souls; 10% increased magic damage and critical strike chance, 15% reduced mana usage; magic critical strikes have a 30% chance to loose an extra spectral flame that homes in for 60% of the hit
GsShroomiteArmor.SetBonusLine: Standing still turns you stealthy as before; 15% increased ranged critical strike chance and a 30% chance not to consume ammo; while deep in stealth, ranged hits have a 30% chance to sprout a spore turret under the target that fires three homing spores
GsSolarArmor.SetBonusLine: Solar shields and the solar dash work as before; each shield also grants 8 defense and 4% damage reduction, and dashing into an enemy triggers a solar explosion for 2x your weapon's damage
GsVortexArmor.SetBonusLine: Vortex stealth works as before; while stealthed, ammo is never consumed and ranged hits have a 40% chance to chain vortex lightning to the nearest other enemy for 70% of the hit; while visible, 15% increased movement speed and 10% ranged critical strike chance
GsNebulaArmor.SetBonusLine: Nebula boosters work as before; each damage booster level also grants 5% magic damage, each life level 2 life regeneration and each mana level 10% reduced mana usage; magic hits have a 25% chance to bloom a nebula flower on the target that pulses twice for 40% of the hit
GsStardustArmor.SetBonusLine: The Stardust Guardian works as before; +3 minion slots and 15% increased summon damage; minion hits have a 20% chance to call a stardust shard that homes in for 80% of the hit
